OL,3,GNEWSANine fire crews tackle blaze at
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine fire crews tackled a blaze at a
OL,7,Fnature reserve.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fwas called to Hampton Nature Reserve,
OL,11,Fwhich runs alongside Fletton Parkway,
OL,12,Fin Peterborough, at about 15:48 BST.
OL,14,FCrews from Dogsthorpe, Yaxley,
OL,15,FStanground, Huntingdon and other
OL,16,Fstations were at the fire, which spread
OL,17,Fto grass and trees.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
